    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the stabilization protocol... okay. what exactly are the parameters of that? i'm seeing some fluctuation in the biometric readings on my end. can you give me the specific frequency and intensity the protocol is using to reinforce the anchor? i need to see if it's actually counteracting the decay or just masking it.",
